    {
      "tipo": "explicacion",
      "titulo": "It happened to me",
      "texto": "**Se me** + verb puts the blame on the accident.\n\n- **Se me olvidó** el nombre. (the name forgot itself on me)\n- **Se me cayeron** las llaves. (the keys fell from me)\n\nThe verb agrees with the **thing**, not with you. One name: olvidó. Several keys: cayeron.\n\n**Me, te, le, nos, les** says who it happened to."
    },
