          "es": "Sí, y se me cayeron las llaves.",
          "en": "Yes, and I dropped the keys.",
          "analisis": [
            ["se me cayeron", "they fell from me"],
            ["las llaves", "the keys"]
          ]
        },
        {
          "quien": "Pablo",
          "es": "Yo olvidé el paraguas.",
          "en": "I forgot the umbrella.",
